[l_english.a_great_fortress_goal_desc]
Preparedness is the key. By securing the border regions, and key points, using the most modern of fortifications, we can ensure that the enemy can't defeat us.

[l_english.a_great_fortress_goal_name]
Build Stronger Fortifications

[l_english.an_armored_fist_goal_desc]
New times create opportunities for new warfare. Tanks are the future. We need to ensure that we, as a faction, have enough to dominate the battlefield.

[l_english.an_armored_fist_goal_name]
Expand Our Armored Forces

[l_english.an_infantry_army_goal_desc]
The backbone of any army is its infantry. We need a sizeable infantry army to back up our claims on both the diplomatic arena, and in the field.

[l_english.an_infantry_army_goal_name]
Expand Our Infantry Forces

[l_english.convoy_sufficiency_goal_desc]
In order to have sufficient capacity to both supply our troops abroad and ensure the material needs of our industry are met with imports from overseas, we must create a sufficiently-large merchant marine.

[l_english.convoy_sufficiency_goal_name]
Convoy Sufficiency

[l_english.faction_goal_unlock_military_desc]
Being able to respond to developing situations with well-structured, joint task forces will become vital as our alliances deepen. We should begin planning for this eventuality immediately.

[l_english.faction_goal_unlock_military_name]
Institute a Joint Command Structure

[l_english.faction_goal_unlock_research_desc]
The development of superior advanced technology is not an idle pastime, but a race against those who would use it to destroy us. Pooling our resources is the only way to ensure our advantage remains competitive.

[l_english.faction_goal_unlock_research_name]
Develop Joint Research Practices

[l_english.growing_the_faction]
Expand the Faction

[l_english.growing_the_faction_desc]
Our faction must have more members if it is to be taken seriously on the geopolitical stage.

[l_english.military_infrastructure_goal_desc]
A well-developed infrastructure is critical in ensuring our border-defense forces have the supplies lines they require.

[l_english.military_infrastructure_goal_name]
Construct Military Infrastructure

[l_english.spy_master_goal_desc]
We should specialize one of our members in the art of espionage and intelligence gathering, allowing them to oversee and direct our alliance's operations.

[l_english.spy_master_goal_name]
Appoint a Spy Master

[l_simp_chinese.a_great_fortress_goal_desc]
精心准备才是关键。通过使用最现代化的防御工事巩固边境地区和战略要地，我们将确保敌人无法击败我们。

[l_simp_chinese.a_great_fortress_goal_name]
修筑更坚固的防御工事

[l_simp_chinese.an_armored_fist_goal_desc]
新时代带来新的战争机遇。坦克是未来的趋势。我们需要确保我们的阵营拥有足够的坦克来主导战场。

[l_simp_chinese.an_armored_fist_goal_name]
扩充我们的装甲部队

[l_simp_chinese.an_infantry_army_goal_desc]
步兵是任何军队的中坚力量。我们需要一支规模可观的步兵部队，为我们在外交场合和战场上的主张提供支持。

[l_simp_chinese.an_infantry_army_goal_name]
扩充我们的步兵部队

[l_simp_chinese.convoy_sufficiency_goal_desc]
为了既能向海外部队提供充足补给，又能通过海外进口满足国内工业的物资需求，我们必须建立一支规模足够庞大的商船队。

[l_simp_chinese.convoy_sufficiency_goal_name]
扩充船队

[l_simp_chinese.faction_goal_unlock_military_desc]
随着我们联盟关系的深化，以结构完善的联合特遣部队应对不断变化的局势显得至关重要。我们应立即着手为此制定计划。

[l_simp_chinese.faction_goal_unlock_military_name]
建立联合指挥架构

[l_simp_chinese.faction_goal_unlock_research_desc]
开发先进的尖端技术并非消遣娱乐之事，而是一场与企图利用技术摧毁我们之人的竞赛。集中整合我们的资源，是确保我们保持竞争优势的唯一途径。

[l_simp_chinese.faction_goal_unlock_research_name]
制定联合研究计划

[l_simp_chinese.growing_the_faction]
扩张阵营

[l_simp_chinese.growing_the_faction_desc]
我方阵营若要在地缘政治舞台上被认真对待，就必须拥有更多成员。

[l_simp_chinese.military_infrastructure_goal_desc]
完善的基础设施对于确保边防部队所需的补给线至关重要。

[l_simp_chinese.military_infrastructure_goal_name]
建设军事基础设施

[l_simp_chinese.spy_master_goal_desc]
我们应指定一位成员国专精于间谍与情报工作，由其负责统筹并指导阵营的各项非行动。

[l_simp_chinese.spy_master_goal_name]
任命一名间谍主管
